{"version":1,"key":"card:623","content":{"id":623,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4bdafe9e-d757-4787-bf16-f7b764fb30b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"kiosk"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 模式又被称为"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff","text":"信息台模式"},{"type":"formatted","text":"或"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff","text":"展台模式"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当用户运行在这种模式下，用户对系统功能的访问受到严格限制，常见于银行 ATM 自动取款机，电影院的自助售票机，它具有如下特点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1aafae21-7632-4457-8b0e-004c2b17cd38","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"28ca87ce-058e-4ec6-b9c4-783509b45378","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cdddfcb5-392e-4a43-9e10-28ae07b370c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"应用全屏，窗口会占据整个屏幕的显示区域"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ea440318-3be2-43f8-b5b9-2e15093cc224","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"952098b5-c6c2-4a8e-a2fd-e272afa5e5ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"覆盖一切，窗口会覆盖系统的界面元素，如任务栏、菜单栏和 Dock 栏"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5cfa8a1a-6921-4377-b952-e57301af81cb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3778714c-cf72-4707-9fa1-c3e8794efeb3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法轻易退出：无法通过快捷键（F11、Esc、Alt + F4）退出程序，也没有标题栏，因此也无法最小化、最大化和关闭，往往需要开发者在窗口内提供某种方式退出"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9f083c7a-2b96-41c6-a4aa-39ea2c01e379","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"kiosk"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fullscreen"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的区别，通过设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fullscreen"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也可以使得窗口全屏，但是在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fullscreen"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 模式下对系统功能的访问并没有受到限制，用户可以通过快捷键退出全屏，可以切换到其他应用，可以直接访问系统能力，控制权掌控在用户手里。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"90f3d698-686c-45d5-aded-aef7dee79bbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从上述的区别就可以看出，kiosk 模式常用于公共或专用自助服务设施，例如 ATM 机、自动售卖机、图书馆的自助系统等等，这些设施都不希望用户能关闭应用或切换到其他应用，也不希望用户能访问系统的能力，比如硬盘；而 fullscreen 则常见于沉浸式的应用，比如游戏、视频播放，提升用户体验，但是用户可以随时退场，也不阻止用户对系统能力的访问。"}]}],"tags":["Electron"],"createTime":1757899056040,"updateTime":1757899067482,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1757899067482}}